 &lt;br /&gt; 
Reportable segment	Description &lt;br /&gt; 
Edible Oils	Crude oils, Refined oils, Vanaspati, Bakery fats, seed extractions and other related products. &lt;br /&gt; 
 &lt;br /&gt; 
